00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:02.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You have a story.
You go to see an endric--

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:03.370 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Endocrinologist.

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:04.170 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What is that?
-I do.

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:07.507
Well, that's somebody -- I have
this thing called hypothyroid,

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:10.110 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is I think common with
some women.

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:12.479 align:start size:94% position:6%
But basically I love my
endocrinologist.

00:00:12.479 --> 00:00:15.615 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I have this thing
called ASMR.

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:19.486 size:81% position:41%
It's like some type of
neurological response

00:00:19.486 --> 00:00:21.521 line:92%
to soft voices and really --

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:26.026 align:start size:94% position:6%
And there's ASMR videos
on YouTube where people go,

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:27.360 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Hi. I'm going to
start the session,"

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.829
and they talk into microphones,
but that doesn't trigger me.

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:33.299 align:start size:94% position:6%
I have to have real people
who have soft voices.

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:34.634 line:92%
And when they have a soft voice,

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:36.302 align:start size:94% position:6%
you get triggered into,
like, a full --

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:38.805 align:start size:94% position:6%
you feel like you're getting
a full body massage.

00:00:38.805 --> 00:00:39.806 line:92%
Like, you feel so relaxed.

00:00:39.806 --> 00:00:41.074 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, that's fantastic.
-Yes.

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:42.976
-So this is kind of a nice thing
to have.

00:00:42.976 --> 00:00:43.543 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-This is so nice.

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:45.111 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I kind of make appointments
with him, just to see him,

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:47.113 align:start size:94% position:6%
because I love the sound of
his voice.

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:49.182 line:92%
I'll be like, "Dr. Cohen,

00:00:49.182 --> 00:00:52.752
I just wanted to check
my blood levels for my thyroid."

00:00:52.752 --> 00:00:57.724
And then he's like "Molly, the
blood levels look very good."

00:00:57.724 --> 00:01:00.727
He's very calm.
I'm not doing a good imitation.

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:04.164 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's so calm,
and so he's just like,

00:01:04.164 --> 00:01:06.666 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I think the blood
looks very good."

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:08.234 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm like,
"Do I have Hashimoto's?"

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:11.604 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he's like --
This story's going nowhere.

00:01:11.604 --> 00:01:13.339 line:92%
-I have a follow-up question.

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:15.708 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Is he aware of what his voice
is doing to you?

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:19.479
-I did. I told him, I go,
"Dr. Cohen, I love your voice."

00:01:19.479 --> 00:01:20.680 size:78% position:39% line:92%
I go, "It's so calm."

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:22.148 line:92%
And he was like, "Thank you."

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:25.285 size:88% position:44%
He goes, "I actually did
an emergency procedure

00:01:25.285 --> 00:01:26.519 line:92%
where we had with other doctors

00:01:26.519 --> 00:01:28.788 align:start size:94% position:6%
practicing during
a high-emergency situation

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:31.524 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they all said
that I was too calm."

00:01:31.524 --> 00:01:33.927 line:92%
And I was like, "Yes, you are."

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:36.963 size:75% position:38%
Yeah, so he just has
such a soft voice.

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:37.530 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-That's great.

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:41.000 align:start size:94% position:6%
But you also, you actually got
an actual physical massage?

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.303 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yes.
-That maybe crossed the line.

00:01:43.303 --> 00:01:43.736 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:01:43.736 --> 00:01:48.208
I was in Ojai, and I had a woman
masseuse, and she was very --

00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:50.310 align:start size:94% position:6%
She didn't speak English
that well, but she was like,

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:52.312 align:start size:94% position:6%
