massaging, massaging.

00:02:01.221 --> 00:02:04.424 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then oils,
I was like, "Ooh, so oily."

00:02:04.424 --> 00:02:05.325 line:92%
-You know, and then she's, like,

00:02:05.325 --> 00:02:08.294 align:start size:94% position:6%
